igne a tenu, et le pari avec."},"en":{"lead":"{T:home:sub} announced a 4-3-3 and attacked in a 3-3-4: a team sheet is a starting point, not a contract. On paper, {T:away:sub} lined up in a 4-2-3-1. On the pitch, in possession, it looked more like a 3-2-4-1.","keys":["{T:home:sub} changes shape by phase: 3-3-4 with the ball, 3-2-3-2 without.","{T:away:sub} changes shape by phase: 3-2-4-1 with the ball, 3-5-2 without.","{T:home:pos} favourite lane: the centre (27% of touches).","{T:away:pos} favourite lane: the left wing (24% of touches)."],"impact":"Out of possession, {T:home:sub} defended higher (back line 34.7 m from goal, against 23.2 m; tournament average: 29.2 m). Defend high and win: the line held, and so did the gamble."}},"s3":{"fr":{"lead":"Pressing à armes égales : 29,2 et 29,2 de PPDA, personne n'a vraiment étouffé l'autre.","keys":["Réaction à la perte : {T:home:sub} récupère 35 % de ses ballons perdus en moins de 5 s, contre 26 %. Une meute.","14 récupérations hautes pour {T:home:sub} (ballons perdus par l'adversaire dans ses 35 derniers mètres) : autant de départs d'actions à deux pas du but.","{T:home:Sub} a contre-pressé fort : 24 % de ses pressions tombent dans les 5 s qui suivent une perte (moyenne du tournoi : 19 %)."],"impact":"À pressing égal, c'est la réaction à la perte qui a fait la différence : {T:home:sub} récupérait plus vite, et gagne."},"en":{"lead":"Even pressing: a PPDA of 29.2 and 29.2, nobody really smothered the other.","keys":["Reaction to losing it: {T:home:sub} win back 35% of lost balls within 5 s, against 26%. A pack.","14 high regains for {T:home:sub} (balls lost by the opponent in their own 35 metres): that many attacks starting next to goal.","Heavy counter-pressing from {T:home:sub}: 24% of pressures come within 5 s of a loss (tournament average: 19%)."],"impact":"With equal pressing, the reaction to losing the ball made the difference: {T:home:sub} won it back faster, and won."}},"s4":{"fr":{"lead":"D'un côté, {T:home:sub} 